@startuml
title Failed Payment - Automatic Refund

actor Customer
participant "PayLink App" as App
participant "Payment Processing" as Payment
participant Biller
participant "Wallet Service" as Wallet
participant Ledger
participant "Notification Service" as Notification
participant "Audit Log" as Audit

Payment -> Biller: Send payment request
Biller --> Payment: Payment rejected

Payment -> Payment: Update status to Failed
Payment -> Wallet: Release held amount

Wallet -> Wallet: Move amount from Held to Available
Wallet -> Ledger: Record hold release
Ledger --> Wallet: Entry recorded

Wallet --> Payment: Hold released successfully
Payment -> Payment: Update status to Refunded

Payment -> Audit: Log Failed and Refunded events
Payment -> Notification: Send failure notification with reason
Notification -> Customer: SMS / Push notification

Payment --> App: Return Refunded status
App --> Customer: Display payment failure and refund confirmation

@enduml
